  <p class="note">
    This page documents how subscribers provide consent to receive operational SMS messages from Aspire Workforce.
  </p>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>How users opt in</h2>
    <p>
      Users opt in during application, onboarding, or assignment setup with staff. The subscriber provides their mobile
      number and gives explicit consent via a paper onboarding SMS consent form (checkbox + signature). Consent is
      recorded and retained in our internal system.
    </p>

    <h2>Disclosures shown to subscribers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Program name:</strong> Aspire Workforce</li>
      <li><strong>Message types:</strong> job/shift offers, assignment confirmations, schedule reminders, time-sensitive updates (changes/cancellations), and support-related messages</li>
      <li><strong>Message frequency:</strong> varies</li>
      <li><strong>Msg &amp; data rates:</strong> may apply</li>
      <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt out</li>
      <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help or email <strong>support@evergrowthdigitalcreations.com</strong></li>
    </ul>

